  "description": "👑 Monarchs Guild – IdleMMO\n\nLooking for a guild that’s chill but focused? Monarchs is a relaxed, friendly guild — but we still take growth and progress seriously. Whether you’re a casual daily player or a dedicated grinder, we’ve got space for you.\n\n🛡️ Our Expectations:\n\nCombat lvl 40+\n\nStay active and contribute when you can\n\nIf you&#039;re inactive for 7–10 days without notice, we’ll assume you’ve quit\n\nCommunication is key — just let us know if you&#039;re away!\n\n💬 Joining our Discord is required\n\nYou must join our Discord to:\n\nVote for raid times\n\nGet raid start notifications\n\nStay updated on events and guild tasks\n\nShare builds, ask questions, and chat with the team\n\nLet us know if you’re going to be inactive\n\n⚔️ We’re here to grow together, clear challenges, and make the game more fun — with no pressure or drama.\n\n🔗 Join now and idle like a monarch. Discord is mandatory.\nAnd combat lvl 40+\n\n[https://discord.gg/Sdt735Vfay]",
